Original path [0, 1], found true, cumulative entries 3.
| limit | actual entries | examined arcs | cutoffs | maximum stack | found |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
| 0 | 1 | 0 | 1 | 1 | false |
| 1 | 2 | 1 | 0 | 2 | true |
\image(figures/iddfs_tiny.svg)
