| SIZE_MAX request effective depth | 2 |
| failed bounded passes | 3 |
| exact event admission | 55 |
| one-short complete event cap | rejected |
| invalid unused endpoint despite start=goal | rejected |
\image(figures/iddfs_controls.svg)
